<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.FEB.97		 PAYDATE	22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $703.38</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	 ISS PRICE   PREMIUM	  GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  $725.00	$17.30	 5.53 PCT	40.66 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  $750.00	$ 8.11	 7.78 PCT	86.73 X</p>
<p> PUT C	   $700.00	$20.60	-3.41 PCT	34.14 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   $725.00	$32.25	-1.51 PCT	21.81 X</p>
<p> PUT E	   $750.00	$49.44	-0.40 PCT	14.23 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
